-### Run The Interactive Simulator
+`frontend/` is a static deck.gl page. Pick a country, operator, scale and mobility
+profile, and it replays precomputed trajectories, colouring each handover by the level
+it reaches (Xn, N2, PSA relocation). Generate a bundle, then serve the directory:
 
 ```bash
-julia --project=. main.jl
+julia --project=. main.jl trajectories spain movistar 25000,10000 all 1200 2
+python3 -m http.server 8000      # open http://localhost:8000/frontend/
 ```
 
-The entry point opens a small menu for running simulations or plotting topology graphs.
+The scale factor is users per agent, so `10000` means more agents than `25000` and a
+heavier page. More options in [frontend/README.md](frontend/README.md).
 
